---
description: Edgeways design-system conformance for UI work
globs: src/app/**,src/components/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Read `docs/design-system.md` before UI changes: colour tokens, page headers, type scale floor, stat strips, pills and lists, layout.
- Design tokens and existing shadcn patterns only; no ad-hoc colours.
- Microcopy is British English, sentence case, commas rather than em dashes.
- No UI type below 11px; prefer 12px (`text-xs`) for XSmall. See `micro-typography.mdc`.
- Render times of day only via `formatClockTime` / `formatClockString` from `src/lib/time-format.ts`.
